# consumer-machinery-home: seed.sh copies core/, scripts/ and templates/ whole into each worker tree and runs the
# enforcement-map validator there (I43 and I44 subjects are files inside those trees), so all three are declared whole.
# .githooks/ is undeclared: the plain run selects --arms I43,I44, which never open it (BL-1098 hermetic differential).
!scripts/validate-enforcement-map.sh
# reason: core/ is copied whole -- cp -R "$DIST/core", core/fixtures/consumer-machinery-home/seed.sh:29; the enforcement-map validator then walks the copy by content.
core/
scripts/
templates/
core/fixtures/lib/mutant.sh
core/fixtures/lib/report.sh
core/fixtures/*/inputs.decl
